     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Howdy folks,<div><br></div><div>Join us tomorrow, at 10:00, for a workshop on <i>Demystifying data reshaping, an intro to pivot_wider() and pivot_longer()</i>. This 30-minute tidyverse practicum, presented by yours truly (Christian John), will cover all your basic needs for turning wide data into tidy data and vice versa. </div><div><br></div><div><div>After that, we will return to our regularly scheduled *programming* (get it?) with D-RUG work group, so there will still be plenty of time to have your various and sundry R-related questions answered by the typical group of R gurus. </div><div><div></div></div></div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/94341983677?pwd=QmhybkJDR0JtNGh5MWhGVy9QR0I3QT09\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://ucdavis.zoom.us/j/94341983677?pwd%3DQmhybkJDR0JtNGh5MWhGVy9QR0I3QT09&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465176975000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1m2HVrvTRWUbvziHuuj1XQ\">Zoom link.</a><br></div><div><br></div><div><div>Can&#39;t wait to see you tomorrow. </div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div>Your D-RUG Coo[R]dinators</div><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">Christian John — Ph.D. candidate</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\">NASA FINESST Future Investigator</div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Pronouns: he/him/his</span><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><br></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\"><div><a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=R2rrihIAAAAJ&amp;hl=en\" targe